%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant S as Auth Service
    participant O as Order Service
    participant D as Database
    participant C as Cache (Redis)

    U->>A: POST /orders (Bearer token)
    A->>S: Validate JWT
    S->>C: Check token revocation list
    C-->>S: Not revoked

    alt Token Valid
        S-->>A: Valid (user_id, roles)
    else Token Expired
        S-->>A: 401 Unauthorized
        A-->>U: 401 - Token expired
    end

    A->>O: Create order (user_id from token)
    O->>D: INSERT order
    D-->>O: OK (order_id)
    O->>C: Cache order (TTL=300s)
    O-->>A: 201 Created (order_id)
    A-->>U: 201 - Order confirmation

    Note over U,D: Subsequent read hits cache first
    U->>A: GET /orders/{id}
    A->>S: Validate JWT
    S-->>A: Valid
    A->>O: Get order
    O->>C: Check cache
    C-->>O: Cache hit (order data)
    O-->>A: 200 OK
    A-->>U: Order details
